  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Branch concurrent requests with pinned ports from one source checkpoint by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1725\n* Create machines from local images over the API under an opt-in local image directory by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1707\n* Bump version to 1.27.1. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1726\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.27.0...v1.27.1",
